  <p id="c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001:m0000" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_A">輿之</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001:m0003" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AA">進之</persName>，仕齊位給事黃門侍郎，扶風太守。梁武帝之舉兵也，所在回應，鄰郡多請<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001:m0038" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AA">進之</persName>同遣修謁。<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangjinzhi:p001:m0045" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AA">進之</persName>曰：「非吾志也。」竟不行。武帝嘉之。梁台建，曆尚書左丞，廣平、天門二郡太守，左衞將軍，封建甯公。</p>
</text>
